#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.static_exception.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.static\\_exception"
msgstr "cuda.tile.static\\_exception"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_exception:1 of
msgid "Marks an exception as compile-time."
msgstr "将异常标记为编译期异常。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_exception:3 of
msgid "Can only be used to wrap the exception of a `raise` statement::"
msgstr "仅可用于包裹 ``raise`` 语句中的异常对象： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_exception:7 of
msgid ""
"The surrounded expression is evaluated at compile time, using the same "
"rules as :py:func:`static_eval`: it can reference global and local "
"variables, and use the full Python syntax, but must not perform any run-"
"time operations."
msgstr ""
"所包裹的表达式在编译期按与 :py:func:`static_eval` 相同的规则进行求值：它可以引用全局变量和局部变量，并可使用完整的 "
"Python 语法，但不得执行任何运行时操作。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_exception:11 of
msgid ""
"The expression must return an exception object. The returned exception is"
" then wrapped in :py:class:`StaticException` and raised at compile time."
msgstr "该表达式必须返回一个异常对象。返回的异常随后会被包装为 :py:class:`StaticException` 并在编译期引发。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_exception:-1 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

